738 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 739 0 R/Alt(Twelve task boxes in four rows with one wavy line running top to bottom between them. Inside the line are tasks a model does reliably: recap a call, draft a reply, post a job, edit a bio, sort the inbox, fix a typo. Outside it are tasks that fail without warning: price a quote, read a contract, post the ledger, approve a refund, sign a lease, call a customer. The line is jagged because the two kinds sit side by side in every row.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block/BBox[63 338.4 387 590.4]>>]/K[0]/Pg 10828 0 R>>
endobj
