<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 773 0 R/Alt(A request flows down through three boxes in turn, the model, your documents and your accounts, and comes out as the answer at the bottom. A side arrow enters each box with the error it can add: the model makes up a price, a policy or a source, what it reads can be wrong, stale or planted, and what it does in your accounts is real, such as a sent email, a changed record or a refund.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block/BBox[63 374.4 387 590.4]>>]/K[0]/Pg 10830 0 R>>
